    "5) Regulatory mapping: task regulatory_analyst to identify applicable AML/CTF regulations, reporting obligations and thresholds for cross-account scatter-gather schemes relevant to INR 3.7M and the entities' jurisdictions; pull specific clauses to support escalation decisions.",
    "6) Iterative refinement: compare graph runs and hypotheses (flow_tracer) with KYC/classification outputs (benign_investigator); replan additional graph probes if needed to close gaps or test alternate money-flow paths.",
    "7) Critical review: reporter_critic to independently compute flow conservation checks on the final graph, evaluate whether the evidence supports suspicion, and prepare a critique listing uncertainties and confidence levels.",
    "8) Decision & reporting handoff: synthesize outputs (flow graphs, KYC/regulatory citations, critic assessment) into a concise escalation package for SAR/reporting or for clearing, reserving one final tool call to produce the formal report."
